<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://w3id.org/cterm> .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "L'ontologia Construction Resources (CR) fornisce un modello semantico per rappresentare le risorse delle costruzioni e le loro relazioni con voci di costo, attività, geometrie e assegnazioni di risorse. Distingue risorse materiali, attrezzature e manodopera e supporta la rappresentazione di quantità, costi, consumi, produttività e informazioni di assegnazione nei processi di costruzione."@it .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "The Construction Resources (CR) Ontology provides a semantic model for representing construction resources and their relationships with cost items, tasks, geometry, and resource assignments. It distinguishes material, equipment, and labour resources and supports the representation of quantities, costs, consumption, productivity, and assignment information in construction processes."@en .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Cassandro, J., Hagedorn, P., Sigalov, K., Gatto, C., Mirarchi, C., Pavan, A., & König, M. (2025). Semantic Integration of Cost, Time and Geometry for a Resource-centred Perspective of Managing Construction Projects: . Proceedings of the 2025 European Conference on Computing in Construction. Publiziert. European Conference on Computing in Construction, Porto. https://doi.org/10.35490/ec3.2025.263" .
