<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "L'ontologia Construction Resources (CR) si basa su concetti e principi della gestione dei progetti di costruzione per fornire una definizione centralizzata delle risorse che possono essere utilizzate come entità condivise nella pianificazione delle attività e nella stima dei costi, garantendo un contesto unificato."@it .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The Construction Resources (CR) Ontology is based on concepts and principles of construction project management to provide a centralized definition of resources that can be used as shared entities with task planning and cost estimation for providing a unified context."@en .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-10-12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/rights> "Copyright 2025 by DABC, PoliMi" .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "The Construction Resources (CR) Ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "cr" .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> <https://w3id.org/cr#> .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.3" .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <https://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/cpm-ont-network/resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <https://schema.org/funding> "The development of the ontology was funded through the NEST project at PoliMi." .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <https://w3id.org/widoco/vocab#introduction> "Construction resources are fundamental production factors in construction processes and must be consistently related to activities, cost items, quantities, and geometrical information. The Construction Resources (CR) Ontology provides a structured representation of material, equipment, and labour resources and supports their assignment to construction tasks and cost information. CR is designed to interoperate with the Cost Item (CI) and Construction Terminology (CTERM) ontologies and includes alignments with Digital Twin Construction (DTC) concepts."@en .
<https://w3id.org/cr> <https://w3id.org/widoco/vocab#introduction> "Le risorse delle costruzioni costituiscono fattori produttivi fondamentali nei processi costruttivi e devono essere correlate in modo coerente ad attività, voci di costo, quantità e informazioni geometriche. L'ontologia Construction Resources (CR) fornisce una rappresentazione strutturata delle risorse materiali, delle attrezzature e della manodopera e ne supporta l'assegnazione alle attività di costruzione e alle informazioni di costo. CR è progettata per interoperare con le ontologie Cost Item (CI) e Construction Terminology (CTERM) e include allineamenti con concetti della Digital Twin Construction (DTC)."@it .
